      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/K._I._Sawyer_Air_Force_Base",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "After nearly forty years of service, the base closed in 1995, ending an era of military presence south of Marquette.",
